data to POSit connect using quarto.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.860
We'll then show you how to
schedule this quarto document

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:35.700
to run using Posit Connect,
which will automatically update

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.080
